{"id":"659d57dcf656b1a5","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-diagonal-computable.md","title":"fact-diagonal-computable — Diagonal Function Computable","display":"fact-diagonal-computable — Diagonal Function Computable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-diagonal-computable","aliases":["92-fact-diagonal-computable"],"display":"fact-diagonal-computable — Diagonal Function Computable","depends_on":["[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]"],"source":"原书第 II 章 pp.24–27 与第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 的有效算术语法背景；此对角程序按本库 prime-power 编码实现，非原书 13 进制字符串函数","source_status":"原书相关有效性结论的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-diagonal-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-diagonal-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-diagonal-computable — Diagonal Function Computable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"af5c6b1bb1806001\" href=\"?note=af5c6b1bb1806001\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-formula\">92-df-arithmetization-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书第 II 章 pp.24–27 与第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 的有效算术语法背景；此对角程序按本库 prime-power 编码实现，非原书 13 进制字符串函数"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关有效性结论的本地实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (diagonal function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\)</span> (formula-code set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (code candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\widehat d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (recursive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\widehat d(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}d(n),&amp;n\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(\\widehat d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\widehat d(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}d(n),&amp;n\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(\\widehat d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> : 对角化函数</li>\n<li>可计算性来自：\n<ol>\n<li>Gödel编码是可计算的</li>\n<li>Numeral构造是可计算的</li>\n<li>代入操作是可计算的</li>\n<li>Gödel解码是可计算的</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>对角函数原本只在公式码上定义；上式用默认值<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>把它扩张为全函数</li>\n<li>在本书固定的有效Gödel编号下，公式码识别与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a>给出的全递归代入共同保证该全扩张递归；任意抽象单射编号不自动具有此性质</li>\n<li>这是可表示性定理的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-formula","status":"resolved","id":"af5c6b1bb1806001","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d$ (diagonal function, see [[92-df-diagonal-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"在本书固定的有效Gödel编号下，公式码识别与[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]给出的全递归代入共同保证该全扩张递归；任意抽象单射编号不自动具有此性质","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\widehat d(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}d(n),&n\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\0,&n\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(\\widehat d)","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1859,"backlinks":[{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ (total recursive extension of $d$, see [[92-fact-diagonal-computable]])"},{"id":"eba4d14b343d9469","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-366","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-diagonal-computable]]"}],"outgoing":["6ad30e82597031a6","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","d65795dc15ebce4b","5d8c59019598b33c","af5c6b1bb1806001"]}